      "mergeID": "69fb4fda4b3fc6540b966e27",
      "mergedPostDetails": "Allow FBT Tracking On /  Off toggle is missing from the Tracking & IK menu.  This is needed to disable Full Body Tracking in the event of a dead battery or issue with your trackers.  Currently now close out of session and restart entire game to switch off FBT.  The automatic switching does not always work properly.",
      "mergedPostTitle": "Allow FBT Tracking On /  Off toggle is missing from the Tracking & IK menu",
      "parentID": null,
      "pinned": false,
      "postDeleted": false,
      "postID": "69adf02f7d7b10a180bbdf1a",
      "private": false,
      "reactions": null,
      "restoredAt": null,
      "sourceFeatureExtractionItemID": null,
      "sourceLink": null,
      "spam": false,
      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "> Allow FBT Tracking On /  Off toggle is missing from the Tracking & IK menu.\n\nDuplicate, can be merged with: https://feedback.vrchat.com/bug-reports/p/allow-fullbody-tracking-fbt-is-missing-from-full-settings\n\n> This is needed to disable Full Body Tracking in the event of a dead battery or issue with your trackers.  Currently now close out of session and restart entire game to switch off FBT.\n\nThis is incorrect, you can disable full-body tracking from the Quick Menu.\n\n> The automatic switching does not always work properly.\n\nYou may have the \"Freeze Tracking on Disconnect\" setting enabled.",
