  "details": "1. Open VRChat, in VR, with FBT equipment connected.\n\n2. Open the quick menu (the one that sticks to your hand)\n\n3. Click the gear (settings) tab\n\n4. Scroll down to \"Tracking & IK\"\n\n5. Note that \"Allow FullBody Tracking FBT\" is an option\n\n6. Double-click the gear tab (or get to the full settings page some other way)\n\n7. Click the \"Tracking & IK\" tab (in the list on the left)\n\n8. Note that there's no \"Allow FullBody Tracking\" toggle anywhere (unless I've somehow missed it every single time I've looked)",
